OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer 'earning #500k' from
OL,4,Aprison cell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer was making "between
OL,7,F#400,000 and #500,000 every two months"
OL,8,Fbefore he was found dead in his cell at
OL,9,Fa Lancashire jail, the Prisons and
OL,10,FProbation Ombudsman has said.
OL,12,FJohnpaul Digweed, who was sentenced in
OL,13,FJune 2022 to 25 years for supplying
OL,14,Fdrugs, was transferred to HMP Garth,
OL,15,Fnear Leyland in Lancashire, the
OL,16,Ffollowing month.
OL,18,FThe 36-year-old "was involved in
OL,19,Forganising drone deliveries of drugs
OL,20,Fand other illicit items" into the
OL,21,Fprison, a report said.
